@FastIngest.SampleApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5093

### Manual Streaming Ingestion - JSON Lines (.jsonl / .ndjson)
POST {{FastIngest.SampleApi_HostAddress}}/api/ingest/customers/jsonl
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="customers.jsonl"
Content-Type: application/x-ndjson

{"id": 1, "email": "alice@example.com", "fullName": "Alice Smith", "balance": 150.50}
{"id": 2, "email": "bob@example.com", "fullName": "Bob Jones", "balance": 200.00}
{"id": 3, "email": "carol@example.com", "fullName": "Carol White", "balance": 99.99}
--WebAppBoundary--

### Dependency Injection Pipeline - Automatic Format Detection
POST {{FastIngest.SampleApi_HostAddress}}/api/customers/import
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="customers.ndjson"
Content-Type: application/x-ndjson

{"id": 1, "email": "alice@example.com", "fullName": "Alice Smith", "balance": 150.50}
{"id": 2, "email": "bob@example.com", "fullName": "Bob Jones", "balance": 200.00}
--WebAppBoundary--

